WEBVTT

00:00:00.751 --> 00:00:06.581
The Agenda tab shows every event. The list puts them all in order, starting with the next one.

00:00:07.082 --> 00:00:12.532
Tap the coloured chips to show or hide a type of event, like rodas, workshops or batizados.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:17.513
Month shows a calendar grid. Swipe left or right to go to another month.

00:00:18.286 --> 00:00:22.036
Year gives you the whole year at a glance, with each event as a coloured bar.

00:00:22.536 --> 00:00:25.836
In every view, tap an event to open all its details.

